title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM snapshots
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the snapshots of a VM: number (optional levels) and age
 of the oldest snapshot (default levels 7/30 days). A configured snapshot
 schedule (VMSS) is shown. Data comes from the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer VM Snapshots} per VM.
